  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759762,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1500 DS Spirits Vol. 1: Mahjong - Nintendo DS Description\n\nDelve into the captivating world of traditional Japanese Mahjong with *1500 DS Spirits Vol. 1: Mahjong* for the Nintendo DS! This authentic adaptation brings the strategic tile-matching game to life, offering a deep and rewarding experience for both seasoned players and newcomers alike. \n\nMaster the intricacies of Mahjong gameplay, utilizing the DS's touch screen for intuitive tile manipulation and strategic planning. Challenge yourself against the AI in a variety of modes, or test your skills against friends locally. \n\nBeyond the core gameplay, *1500 DS Spirits Vol. 1: Mahjong* includes a unique \"Furikomi Quiz\" mode, featuring 110 questions designed to expand your knowledge of Japanese culture and Mahjong terminology. This engaging quiz adds an extra layer of depth and entertainment to the experience. Immerse yourself in the rich traditions of Japanese Mahjong and discover the strategic brilliance of this timeless classic!"
    },
